-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
<YOUR_CLIENT_CERTIFICATE>

This certificate is generated during the CloudHSM cluster initialization process.

To obtain this file:
  1. Initialize your CloudHSM cluster
  2. Create and sign a cluster CSR using your CA
  3. The resulting signed certificate is your client.crt

File location on Linux server after setup:
  /opt/cloudhsm/etc/client.crt
-----END CERTIFICATE-----